---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<footer id="contact" class="bg-pro-500 text-ivory-500 px-8 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto flex flex-col xl:flex-row justify-between items-center xl:items-start gap-12">
    
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center xl:items-start gap-4 order-2 xl:order-1">
      <p class="text-sm opacity-80">
        &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Nutrifit Andrea Guerrero. Todos los derechos reservados.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[10px] opacity-50 max-w-xs text-center xl:text-left leading-tight italic">
        Este sitio utiliza cookies para analizar el tráfico y mejorar tu experiencia. 
        Al navegar, aceptas nuestra política de uso de datos.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 order-1 xl:order-2">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-center xl:text-right tracking-wider">
        Conectemos
      </h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 xl:flex xl:flex-col gap-8 xl:gap-4 items-center xl:items-end">
        <a id="instagram-from-website" href="https://www.instagram.com/nutrifit_andrea_guerrero" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-primary transition-all hover:scale-110 flex gap-x-4 items-center group">
          <Icon name="simple-icons:instagram" class="size-10 xl:size-6" />
          <span class="hidden xl:inline group-hover:underline">Instagram</span>
        </a>
        
        <a id="whatsapp-footer-from-website" href="https://wa.me/..." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-primary transition-all hover:scale-110 flex gap-x-4 items-center group">
          <Icon name="simple-icons:whatsapp" class="size-10 xl:size-6" />
          <span class="hidden xl:inline group-hover:underline">WhatsApp</span>
        </a>

        <a id="facebook-from-website" href="https://www.facebook.com/..." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-primary transition-all hover:scale-110 flex gap-x-4 items-center group">
          <Icon name="simple-icons:facebook" class="size-10 xl:size-6" />
          <span class="hidden xl:inline group-hover:underline">Facebook</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>